description	"Jedi Knight 

3-life Jedi with customizable Force Powers and Lightsaber attributes.

^2Weaponry: 
- Melee
- Lightsaber
-- Short Saber (Yellow/Blue)
-- Dual Shotos (Duals/Cyan)
-- Single Shoto (Red/Purple)
-- Double Bladed (Staff)
-- Lower Damage Heavy Styles, Higher Damage Light Styles
-- Saber Throw ^3[CS1]

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcement (2)
- Force Focus (2)
- Assemble (2)"